        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2123, Rustic Modern Mortise Keyed Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sandcast Bronze Rustic Modern Rectangular Keyed Entry Pocket Door offers security to sliding doors. This Rustic Modern Mortise Keyed Pocket Door Hardware is operated from the exterior by a key and by a thumbturn from the interior. The latch hooks into the door frame to secure the pocket door. The Rustic Modern Keyed Pocket Door Hardware is available in flat black, medium bronze, and tumble white bronze finishes. It comes packaged with 2 flush pulls (one for each side of the door), a keyed mortise lock with cylinder, pop-out edge pull, and the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Keyed Lock:</b> Use when a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/rustic-modern-rectangular-dummy-pocket-door-set-emtek-2126\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/rustic-modern-rectangular-passage-pocket-door-set-emtek-2124\"><b>Passage Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/sandcast-bronze-rustic-modern-rectangular-privacy-pocket-door-set-emtek-2125\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Modern Rustic Rectangular Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Projection: 23/25\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2123-specifications.pdf?v=1704262401\"><b>Emtek 2123 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a keyed mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
